                    | Menu
                    i.fas.fa-bars.ms-1
                #navbarResponsive.collapse.navbar-collapse
                    ul.navbar-nav.text-uppercase.ms-auto.py-4.py-lg-0
                        li.nav-item
                            a.nav-link(href='#services') Services
                        li.nav-item
                            a.nav-link(href='#portfolio') Portfolio
                        li.nav-item
                            a.nav-link(href='#about') About
                        li.nav-item
                            a.nav-link(href='#team') Team
                        li.nav-item
                            a.nav-link(href='#contact') Contact
        // Masthead
        header.masthead
            #particles-js
            .container
                .masthead-subheading Welcome To Our Studio!
                .masthead-heading.text-uppercase It's Nice To Meet You
                a.btn.btn-primary.btn-xl.text-uppercase(href='#services') Tell Me More

        // Services
        section#services.page-section
            .container
                .text-center
                    h2.section-heading.text-uppercase.text-gradient Services
                    h3.section-subheading.text-muted Delivering innovative digital solutions that drive growth and elevate your brand's digital presence.
                .row.text-center
                    .col-md-4.mb-4.mb-md-0
                        .glass-card.p-5.h-100
                            span.fa-stack.fa-4x.mb-4
                                i.fas.fa-circle.fa-stack-2x.text-primary
                                i.fas.fa-code.fa-stack-1x.fa-inverse
                            h4.my-3 Custom Development
                            p.text-muted
                                | Scalable, high-performance web and mobile applications tailored precisely to your unique business logic.
                    .col-md-4.mb-4.mb-md-0
                        .glass-card.p-5.h-100
                            span.fa-stack.fa-4x.mb-4
                                i.fas.fa-circle.fa-stack-2x.text-primary
                                i.fas.fa-paint-brush.fa-stack-1x.fa-inverse
                            h4.my-3 UI/UX Design
                            p.text-muted
                                | Intuitive, award-winning digital experiences and interfaces that captivate users and maximize conversion rates.
                    .col-md-4
                        .glass-card.p-5.h-100
                            span.fa-stack.fa-4x.mb-4
                                i.fas.fa-circle.fa-stack-2x.text-primary
                                i.fas.fa-chart-line.fa-stack-1x.fa-inverse
                            h4.my-3 Digital Strategy
                            p.text-muted
                                | Data-driven marketing, SEO, and growth strategies designed to accelerate your brand's online dominance.

