        // About
        section#about.page-section
            .container
                .text-center
                    h2.section-heading.text-uppercase.text-gradient About
                    h3.section-subheading.text-muted Our journey.
                ul.timeline
                    li
                        .timeline-image
                            img.rounded-circle.img-fluid(src='assets/img/about/1.jpg', alt='...')
                        .timeline-panel
                            .timeline-heading
                                h4 2018 - 2019
                                h4.subheading The Spark of Innovation
                            .timeline-body
                                p.text-muted
                                    | Founded by a small group of visionary developers and designers, NEXTGEN started with a simple goal: to disrupt traditional digital experiences by blending cutting-edge code with breathtaking aesthetics.
                    li.timeline-inverted
                        .timeline-image
                            img.rounded-circle.img-fluid(src='assets/img/about/2.jpg', alt='...')
                        .timeline-panel
                            .timeline-heading
                                h4 2020 - 2021
                                h4.subheading Scaling New Heights
                            .timeline-body
                                p.text-muted
                                    | As our reputation for delivering high-performance, responsive applications grew, so did our team. We expanded our services to include comprehensive UI/UX design and enterprise-level web security architectures.
                    li
                        .timeline-image
                            img.rounded-circle.img-fluid(src='assets/img/about/3.jpg', alt='...')
                        .timeline-panel
                            .timeline-heading
                                h4 2022
                                h4.subheading The Web3 Transition
                            .timeline-body
                                p.text-muted
                                    | Recognizing the shift in digital ownership and decentralized technologies, we integrated Web3 infrastructure and blockchain development into our core offerings, empowering forward-thinking startups.
                    li.timeline-inverted
                        .timeline-image
                            img.rounded-circle.img-fluid(src='assets/img/about/4.jpg', alt='...')
                        .timeline-panel
                            .timeline-heading
                                h4 2024 - Present
                                h4.subheading The AI Revolution
                            .timeline-body
